      "id": "claim_79bdd03adc43464e822f8c5d27d48f97",
      "statement": "The CI workflow is the merge gate of record for this repository: on pull requests and pushes to `main` it runs backend lint plus a large set of deterministic assurance tests, including wiki fidelity, OKF authoring/profile checks, publication contracts, route snapshots, architecture/import-boundary gates, MCP discovery/auth/drift gates, and tenancy/access-control tests.",
