      "statement": "`scripts/gates.py` deliberately derives local gate execution from `.github/workflows/ci.yml` instead of keeping a second hand-maintained list: it parses executable `run:` steps, respects job and step `working-directory`, skips setup-only commands, defaults to the offline deterministic `backend` and `mcp-app` jobs, supports filtering and listing, and reports missing local executables as loud skips rather than false greens.",
