      "statement": "`apps/backend/tests/architecture/module_graph_test.py` is a refactor-honesty gate that assigns every Python file under `app/` to a target module, builds a cross-module import graph from the AST, fails if a file is unmapped, and fails on any newly introduced cross-module edge while naming the files that created it.",
