      "id": "claim_702da17d4a74417eb668e422ce8b85fd",
      "statement": "The repository protects route-surface parity as a separate assurance concern: CI includes a route snapshot gate that boots the backend under `self_hosted` and `shared` profiles and compares the resulting method+path surface to recorded fixtures, alongside supporting gates that keep module-invocation and filesystem-anchor assumptions from silently breaking under code moves.",
