      "id": "claim_7b237d5bb416472a85eb68a5fa55225c",
      "statement": "`apps/backend/eval/wiki_fidelity_test.py` is the ingest-safety gate for externally generated wiki bundles: it loads pages from `knowledge/wiki-bundle/<component>/<version>/pages`, computes fidelity with the same `_fidelity_report` logic used by the wiki builder, rejects bundles with any worktree citation, and enforces the configured fidelity floor before a bundle may be ingested.",
