      "id": "claim_b5804616224b406285778ea513aca0ad",
      "statement": "`apps/mcp/tests/client_surface_test.py` is the end-to-end protocol-surface gate for the standalone MCP app: it builds the real ASGI app, swaps in an offline static token verifier and fake domain/document seams, then uses a real `fastmcp.Client` over in-process HTTP to prove that a `Reader` can list read surfaces and read the document resource while a caller with no roles sees no tools, prompts, or templates, gets no completion suggestions, and cannot read or leak document content.",
