      "statement": "The CI workflow treats authoring and publication as contract surfaces rather than one opaque feature test by running separate OKF gates for envelope/identity/publication state, references and tenancy-safe immutable revisions, write permissions, schemas and fixtures, migration compatibility, multi-document ChangeSet proposal/review, and actor/timestamp rules before publication and reconciliation tests run.",
